  v_submit["Record entry and return for <br/>independent requests. Do <br/>not assume call-start order <br/>is the global submission <br/>order."]
  v_post["Record where the message is <br/>added to list#95; under mutex#95;."]
  v_queue["If the message is <br/>processed, record its <br/>registration in <br/>waitingRequests#95; on the <br/>CameraManager thread."]
  v_stop["Record the stop path after <br/>the isRunning and access <br/>checks pass. The caller <br/>must synchronize with other <br/>functions that affect <br/>camera state."]
  v_pipeline_stop["Record the <br/>ConnectionTypeBlocking call <br/>and its return. Across <br/>threads, the caller waits <br/>for that invocation to <br/>complete."]
  v_queued["The separate Queued branch <br/>posts a message and <br/>immediately returns false, <br/>so the sender does not wait <br/>for invocation to finish."]
  v_receiver["If the slot runs, record <br/>its last use. Before <br/>deletion or reuse, confirm <br/>pointer and reference <br/>validity and receiver <br/>completion."]
  v_submit -->|"A successful call selects <br/>ConnectionTypeQueued."| v_post
  v_post -->|"If the message is <br/>processed, observe the <br/>registration."| v_queue
